  "prefLabel": "Rev 501.08 Municipal assessing officials",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-03-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 501.08 “Municipal assessing officials” means those charged by law with the duty of assessing taxes in the city, town, or unincorporated place.\n\nSource. #7381, eff 10-24-00; ss and moved by #7860, eff 3-31-03 (formerly Rev 501.06), EXPIRED: 3-31-11\n\nNew. #9926, eff 5-18-11; ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
